            "Order": 1,
            "GroupOrder": 1,
            "SpeakerName": "仁花子的朋友1",
            "FontSize": 2,
            "Phrase": "呐呐，舍人同学！前阵子的《青发公爵的不归之妻》，我去看了哦——！/n舍人同学是主演？对吧！",
            "BackgroundImageFileName": "30",
            "BgmFileName": "402",
            "VoiceFileName": "1424610010",
            "CharacterMotions": [],
            "SpeakerIconId": "1"
        },
        {
            "Id": 142461002,
            "EpisodeMasterId": 142461,
            "Order": 1,
            "GroupOrder": 2,
            "SpeakerName": "仁花子",
            "FontSize": 2,
            "Phrase": "诶，你来看啦！谢谢！！/n严格来说算是双主演……嘿嘿……。",
            "VoiceFileName": "1424610020",
            "CharacterMotions": [
                {
                    "slotNumber": 1,
                    "FacialExpressionMasterId": 200,
                    "BodyMotionMasterId": 20,
                    "LipSyncMasterId": 1,
                    "SpineId": 20302,
                    "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
                    "CharacterPosition": 3,
                    "CharacterLayerType": 1,
                    "SpineSize": 2
                }
            ],
            "SpeakerIconId": "203"
        },
        {
            "Id": 142461003,
            "EpisodeMasterId": 142461,
            "Order": 1,
            "GroupOrder": 3,
            "SpeakerName": "仁花子的朋友2",
            "FontSize": 2,
            "Phrase": "那种有点吓人的演技什么的～……真的特别棒！/n我很喜欢Eden剧团那种黑暗氛围的舞台～。",
            "VoiceFileName": "1424610030",
            "CharacterMotions": [],
            "SpeakerIconId": "1"
        },
        {
            "Id": 142461004,
            "EpisodeMasterId": 142461,
            "Order": 1,
            "GroupOrder": 4,
            "SpeakerName": "仁花子",
            "FontSize": 2,
            "Phrase": "真的？剧团的大家听见一定也会很高兴！/n尤其是负责全部剧本和演出的连小姐！",
            "VoiceFileName": "1424610040",
            "CharacterMotions": [
                {
                    "slotNumber": 1,
                    "FacialExpressionMasterId": 101,
                    "BodyMotionMasterId": 13,
                    "LipSyncMasterId": 2,
                    "SpineId": 20302,
                    "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
                    "CharacterPosition": 3,
                    "CharacterLayerType": 1,
                    "SpineSize": 2
                }
            ],
            "SpeakerIconId": "203"
        },
        {
            "Id": 142461005,
            "EpisodeMasterId": 142461,
            "Order": 1,
            "GroupOrder": 5,
            "SpeakerName": "仁花子的朋友2",
            "FontSize": 2,
            "Phrase": "那难道就是连尺野初魅小姐？/n那个人超帅的～！！",
            "VoiceFileName": "1424610050",
            "CharacterMotions": [],
            "SpeakerIconId": "1"
        },
        {
            "Id": 142461006,
            "EpisodeMasterId": 142461,
            "Order": 1,
            "GroupOrder": 6,
            "SpeakerName": "仁花子的朋友2",
            "FontSize": 2,
            "Phrase": "上次舞台上，/n她和舍人同学面对面的那段，我都忍不住看入迷了……！",
            "VoiceFileName": "1424610060",
            "CharacterMotions": [],
            "SpeakerIconId": "1"
        },
        {
            "Id": 142461007,
            "EpisodeMasterId": 142461,
            "Order": 1,
            "GroupOrder": 7,
            "SpeakerName": "仁花子的朋友1",
            "FontSize": 2,
            "Phrase": "不过那时候的舍人同学也很不错！/n该怎么说呢……感觉看到了平时绝对看不到的表情！",
            "VoiceFileName": "1424610070",
            "CharacterMotions": [],
            "SpeakerIconId": "1"
        },
        {
            "Id": 142461008,
            "EpisodeMasterId": 142461,
            "Order": 1,
            "GroupOrder": 8,
            "SpeakerName": "仁花子的朋友2",
            "FontSize": 2,
            "Phrase": "确实！那样的舍人同学特别新鲜～！/n像精神变态一样？就是那种反派！",
            "VoiceFileName": "1424610080",
            "CharacterMotions": [],
            "SpeakerIconId": "1"
        },
        {
            "Id": 142461009,
            "EpisodeMasterId": 142461,
            "Order": 1,
            "GroupOrder": 9,
            "SpeakerName": "仁花子",
            "FontSize": 2,
            "Phrase": "是、是吗……？/n有些角色的话，我也会演那一类哦？",
            "VoiceFileName": "1424610090",
            "CharacterMotions": [
                {
                    "slotNumber": 1,
                    "FacialExpressionMasterId": 103,
                    "BodyMotionMasterId": 11,
                    "LipSyncMasterId": 1,
                    "SpineId": 20302,
                    "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
                    "CharacterPosition": 3,
                    "CharacterLayerType": 1,
                    "SpineSize": 2
                }
            ],
            "SpeakerIconId": "203"
        },
        {
            "Id": 142461010,
            "EpisodeMasterId": 142461,
            "Order": 1,
            "GroupOrder": 10,
            "SpeakerName": "仁花子的朋友2",
            "FontSize": 2,
            "Phrase": "诶——，之前完全想象不到舍人同学会演反派～！",
            "VoiceFileName": "1424610100",
            "CharacterMotions": [],
            "SpeakerIconId": "1"
        },
        {
            "Id": 142461011,
            "EpisodeMasterId": 142461,
            "Order": 1,
            "GroupOrder": 11,
            "SpeakerName": "仁花子的朋友1",
            "FontSize": 2,
            "Phrase": "嗯嗯，完全没那种印象～。/n就像现在这样聊起来，明明就是普通的女高中生！",
            "VoiceFileName": "1424610110",
            "CharacterMotions": [],
            "SpeakerIconId": "1"
        },
        {
            "Id": 142461012,
            "EpisodeMasterId": 142461,
            "Order": 1,
            "GroupOrder": 12,
            "SpeakerName": "仁花子的朋友1",
            "FontSize": 2,
            "Phrase": "所以舍人同学演反派很少见啊！",
            "VoiceFileName": "1424610120",
            "CharacterMotions": [],
            "SpeakerIconId": "1"
        },
        {
            "Id": 142461013,
            "EpisodeMasterId": 142461,
            "Order": 1,
            "GroupOrder": 13,
            "SpeakerName": "仁花子",
            "FontSize": 2,
            "Phrase": "哈哈……是、是吗？/n我自己倒不太清楚……。",
            "VoiceFileName": "1424610130",
            "CharacterMotions": [
                {
                    "slotNumber": 1,
                    "FacialExpressionMasterId": 202,
                    "BodyMotionMasterId": 20,
                    "LipSyncMasterId": 1,
                    "SpineId": 20302,
                    "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
                    "CharacterPosition": 3,
                    "CharacterLayerType": 1,
                    "SpineSize": 2
                }
            ],
            "SpeakerIconId": "203"
        },
        {
            "Id": 142461014,
            "EpisodeMasterId": 142461,
            "Order": 1,
            "GroupOrder": 14,
            "SpeakerName": "仁花子的朋友2",
            "FontSize": 2,
            "Phrase": "塑造角色的时候是不是很辛苦？/n也许平时都很辛苦啦……但你看，反派和你平时差那么多！",
            "VoiceFileName": "1424610140",
            "CharacterMotions": [],
            "SpeakerIconId": "1"
        },
        {
            "Id": 142461015,
            "EpisodeMasterId": 142461,
            "Order": 1,
            "GroupOrder": 15,
            "SpeakerName": "仁花子",
            "FontSize": 2,
            "Phrase": "嗯——……倒也没有比塑造其他角色更辛苦。/n就是拼命练习，然后不知不觉就进入角色了。",
            "VoiceFileName": "1424610150",
            "CharacterMotions": [
                {
                    "slotNumber": 1,
                    "FacialExpressionMasterId": 102,
                    "BodyMotionMasterId": 7,
                    "LipSyncMasterId": 4,
                    "SpineId": 20302,
                    "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
                    "CharacterPosition": 3,
                    "CharacterLayerType": 1,
                    "SpineSize": 2
                }
            ],
            "SpeakerIconId": "203"
        },
        {
            "Id": 142461016,
            "EpisodeMasterId": 142461,
            "Order": 1,
            "GroupOrder": 16,
            "SpeakerName": "仁花子的朋友1",
            "FontSize": 2,
            "Phrase": "诶——！好意外！/n那种角色感觉绝对会很难啊！",
            "VoiceFileName": "1424610160",
            "CharacterMotions": [],
            "SpeakerIconId": "1"
        },
        {
            "Id": 142461017,
            "EpisodeMasterId": 142461,
            "Order": 1,
            "GroupOrder": 17,
            "SpeakerName": "仁花子的朋友2",
            "FontSize": 2,
            "Phrase": "对吧！感觉对舍人同学来说，应该是完全无法想象的类型！",
            "VoiceFileName": "1424610170",
            "CharacterMotions": [],
            "SpeakerIconId": "1"
        },
        {
            "Id": 142461018,
            "EpisodeMasterId": 142461,
            "Order": 1,
            "GroupOrder": 18,
            "SpeakerName": "仁花子",
            "FontSize": 2,
            "Phrase": "嘛，我也觉得伤害别人是不对的……。/n不过青发公爵也有属于她自己的爱……。",
            "VoiceFileName": "1424610180",
            "CharacterMotions": [
                {
                    "slotNumber": 1,
                    "FacialExpressionMasterId": 102,
                    "BodyMotionMasterId": 11,
                    "LipSyncMasterId": 4,
                    "SpineId": 20302,
                    "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
                    "CharacterPosition": 3,
                    "CharacterLayerType": 1,
                    "SpineSize": 2
                }
            ],
            "SpeakerIconId": "203"
        },
        {
            "Id": 142461019,
            "EpisodeMasterId": 142461,
            "Order": 1,
            "GroupOrder": 19,
            "SpeakerName": "仁花子",
            "FontSize": 2,
            "Phrase": "包括这些在内，我觉得很新鲜，也演得很开心哦？/n饰演青发公爵这个角色！",
            "VoiceFileName": "1424610190",
            "CharacterMotions": [
